        <term:bibliographicCitation>Lakhiani, Chrisovalantis, Michael R. Lee, und Michel Saint-Cyr. „Vascular Anatomy of the Anterolateral Thigh Flap: A Systematic Review“. Plastic and Reconstructive Surgery 130, Nr. 6 (Dezember 2012): 1254. https://doi.org/10.1097/PRS.0b013e31826d1662.</term:bibliographicCitation>
